// 2 hypnotised, 3 remembered, 4 token, 5 return the jar, 6 stole it, 7 returned, 8 ceremony, 19
// symbol hidden, 20 fight, 22 priest beaten, 25 back to town, 26 complete). Also clears the
// flashback and sets the things the stage needs (a jar for 2-6, the pyramid door's rocks).
[debugproc,icsstage](int $n)
